                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I went to Leisure World for a town hall and heard from residents about their greatest concerns: cuts to Social Security, Medicaid, and more. \n\nI assured them that in spite of this Admin's cruelty, we are fighting back. I will always defend seniors and their hard-earned benefits. https://t.co/2IH1KXJAsJ",
