                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Republican cuts to Medicaid and Medicare are devastating our seniors. During a meeting in Annapolis many told me they\u2019re worried about affording their prescriptions, cuts to VA benefits, and more.\n\nI promised that I will always fight to protect their health care and benefits. https://t.co/lXraVvKrFb",
