                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I'm committed to fighting for special education and support services - especially as Americans with disabilities are bracing for cuts to their Medicaid.\n\nWe need more places like Harbour School in Annapolis - focused on learning, inspiring, and preparing students for the future. https://t.co/sUPLuidQMO",
