                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 6,
                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I visited Marylanders at Collington senior community.\n\nNearly every one of them told me how this Republican scam of a bill would hurt them.\n\nKicking Marylanders off their health care is utterly callous.\n\nI'll always fight to protect Medicare and Medicaid. https://t.co/XTPWaSeBs6",
